### 网络扫描 API 测试文件

### 1. 完整网络扫描
GET http://localhost:3000/api/network/scan
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. 扫描指定子网
GET http://localhost:3000/api/network/scan?subnet=192.168.1.0/24
Content-Type: application/json

### 3. 快速网络扫描
GET http://localhost:3000/api/network/quick-scan
Content-Type: application/json

### 4. 获取在线设备
GET http://localhost:3000/api/network/devices/online
Content-Type: application/json

### 5. 获取所有设备（包括离线）
GET http://localhost:3000/api/network/devices/all
Content-Type: application/json

### 6. 搜索设备 - 按IP
GET http://localhost:3000/api/network/devices/search?ip=192.168.1
Content-Type: application/json

### 7. 搜索设备 - 按MAC地址
GET http://localhost:3000/api/network/devices/search?mac=00:50:56
Content-Type: application/json

### 8. 搜索设备 - 按主机名
GET http://localhost:3000/api/network/devices/search?hostname=router
Content-Type: application/json

### 9. 网络状态检查
GET http://localhost:3000/api/network/status
Content-Type: application/json

### 10. 健康检查
GET http://localhost:3000/health
Content-Type: application/json
